 "headline": [
  "On nobond_vt08, one sheet filled one open late is worth -929 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 418 sheets, p10..p90 -10,306..5,931); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -12.0 bps with t=-4.55. The 418 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 1e-03 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 1.90pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it.",
  "On nobond_base, one sheet filled one open late is worth -1,435 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 418 sheets, p10..p90 -20,567..11,338); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -18.8 bps with t=-4.27. The 418 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 2e-03 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 3.68pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it."
